ecord runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. November to December 2025 came in at 20% of normal on the middle, and January to February 2026 followed at 34%. Grid 8597 had its driest year in 2000, at 58% of normal.</p>"}
